Read and follow repository-root `AGENTS.md` for every task.
Before editing, read `AUTHORITY.md`, `CURRENT_STATUS.md`, `UP_NEXT.md`, and `docs/BUILD_BRIEF.md`.
Use the working tree and Git history to verify those documents; never assume a pending task is already implemented.
Update checkpoint documents after meaningful work and before switching IDEs.
Commit verified coherent changes frequently with short single-line conventional subjects.
